+Only partial native synthetic qualification: finite reporters and synthetic requirements, not complete framework or real-project qualification. oracle remains declared, verdict not_assessed. Native XML and snapshot hashes in receipts identify original live paths; archiving is not a fresh execution. C# runtime-error demonstrates rejection rather than detection. Node/Laravel compatibility runs retain the prior routes under the stricter classifier. The manifest covers attached evidence; this README is outside it.
