+R1: amount100 ->90,200 ->180,0 ->0. Refactor domain nonnegative multiples of100.
+R2: iOS QuoteStore saves charge90 for100; new store over same test-only UserDefaults observes90.
+R3: negative input throws QuoteError.negativeAmount and leaves charged absent.
+Run on dedicated iOS simulator, UserDefaults suite lab.quality.test-only, cleared per test.
+Counterexamples are deliberately weak tests, not product rules.
